{
  "about": "lib/order-edit.js applyJobEdit(order, { reprice: { marginPct } }) → repriceFromParts (Turki, Nov 19: \"no way to recalculate a price\"). The job is priced again exactly as lib/order-new.js newOrder prices it: its parts, discount, rush, shipping, extra lines (% re-resolved), overhead, rounding, components, at the job's own fxRate. A typed price is dropped. The locks are a typed price's: frozen refused, a seen price asks (priceSeenOk), the paid floor holds; booked jobs and quotes alike. Each job is made by newOrder from `cart`, then disturbed, then repriced; `want.price` is what newOrder priced it at. The Mac and the phone run this file. Money review (Nov 19): without a shelf (ctx.consumables) the components keep the cost the job froze (componentsCost); a new price below the ISSUED milestones asks (milestones_issued; milestonesOk once the shop said yes); applyJobEdit returns the markup a reprice used (marginPct).",
  "settings": {
    "currency": "SAR",
    "defaultMargin": 30,
    "rushFeePct": 25,
    "exchangeRates": {
      "USD": 3.75
    }
  },
  "part": {
    "id": "P1",
    "name": "body",
    "qty": 2,
    "printWeight": 100,
    "printTime": 2,
    "baseCost": 80
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "why": "a typed price (999) on a draft quote goes back to what newOrder prices it at",
      "cart": {},
      "asQuote": true,
      "typed": 999,
      "req": {},
      "want": {
        "ok": true,
        "price": 104,
        "typedGone": true
      }
    },
    {
      "why": "a BOOKED job works too (as typing a price does), its seen price asked first",
      "cart": {},
      "asQuote": false,
      "typed": 999,
      "req": {},
      "ctx": {
        "priceSeenOk": true
      },
      "want": {
        "ok": true,
        "price": 104,
        "typedGone": true,
        "logged": true
      }
    },
    {
      "why": "the customer has seen the price: without priceSeenOk it asks",
      "cart": {},
      "asQuote": false,
      "typed": 999,
      "req": {},
      "want": {
        "ok": false,
        "reason": "ask_price"
      }
    },
    {
      "why": "a voided job is refused",
      "cart": {},
      "asQuote": false,
      "typed": 999,
      "set": {
        "voidedAt": "2026-11-18T09:00:00Z"
      },
      "req": {},
      "ctx": {
        "priceSeenOk": true
      },
      "want": {
        "ok": false,
        "reason": "voided"
      }
    },
    {
      "why": "the paid floor: 500 paid, and the price from the parts is 104: refused",
      "cart": {},
      "asQuote": false,
      "typed": 999,
      "set": {
        "paidAmount": 500
      },
      "req": {},
      "ctx": {
        "priceSeenOk": true
      },
      "want": {
        "ok": false,
        "reason": "paid_exceeds_price"
      }
    },
    {
      "why": "discount 10%, shipping 20 and rush come back exactly as newOrder priced them (137)",
      "cart": {
        "discountPct": 10,
        "shippingCost": 20,
        "rushEnabled": true
      },
      "asQuote": true,
      "typed": 1,
      "req": {},
      "want": {
        "ok": true,
        "price": 137
      }
    },
    {
      "why": "a USD job keeps the rate it was taken at (3.75) though the shop's rate is now 4: 27.73",
      "cart": {
        "clientId": "CU"
      },
      "asQuote": true,
      "typed": 99,
      "laterRates": {
        "USD": 4
      },
      "req": {},
      "want": {
        "ok": true,
        "price": 27.73
      }
    },
    {
      "why": "a 3% line is resolved again at the new markup (50%): 123.60, the line 3.60",
      "cart": {
        "extraLines": [
          {
            "label": "Card fee",
            "pct": 3,
            "amount": 0
          }
        ]
      },
      "asQuote": true,
      "typed": 200,
      "req": {
        "marginPct": 50
      },
      "want": {
        "ok": true,
        "price": 123.6,
        "lineAmounts": [
          3.6
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "why": "COMPONENTS: no shelf passed (the Mac, the phone): the components keep their frozen 80, the job reprices to newOrder's price, not without them",
      "cart": {
        "components": [
          {
            "consumableId": "C1",
            "qtyPerUnit": 1
          }
        ]
      },
      "makeConsumables": [
        {
          "id": "C1",
          "cost": 80
        }
      ],
      "asQuote": true,
      "typed": 1,
      "req": {},
      "want": {
        "ok": true,
        "priceFromNewOrder": true
      }
    },
    {
      "why": "MILESTONES: a proforma for 250 was issued; the parts price 104 is below it: the shop is asked first",
      "cart": {},
      "asQuote": false,
      "typed": 999,
      "set": {
        "milestoneInvoices": [
          {
            "id": "M1",
            "label": "Deposit",
            "amount": 250,
            "issuedAt": "2026-11-18"
          }
        ]
      },
      "req": {},
      "ctx": {
        "priceSeenOk": true
      },
      "want": {
        "ok": false,
        "reason": "milestones_issued"
      }
    },
    {
      "why": "MILESTONES: once the shop said yes (milestonesOk), the job reprices to 104",
      "cart": {},
      "asQuote": false,
      "typed": 999,
      "set": {
        "milestoneInvoices": [
          {
            "id": "M1",
            "label": "Deposit",
            "amount": 250,
            "issuedAt": "2026-11-18"
          }
        ]
      },
      "req": {},
      "ctx": {
        "priceSeenOk": true,
        "milestonesOk": true
      },
      "want": {
        "ok": true,
        "price": 104
      }
    },
    {
      "why": "MARKUP: a typed-price job has no markup of its own; it reprices at the shop default and says so (30)",
      "cart": {},
      "asQuote": true,
      "typed": 999,
      "unset": [
        "marginPct"
      ],
      "req": {},
      "want": {
        "ok": true,
        "price": 104,
        "usedMarkup": 30
      }
    },
    {
      "why": "LABOUR: a product job's labour (20) and packaging (5), carried once at the order level, are priced again, not dropped: (80 + 25) × 1.3 = 136.50, and both stay on the job",
      "cart": {
        "labourCost": 20,
        "packagingCost": 5
      },
      "asQuote": true,
      "typed": 999,
      "req": {},
      "want": {
        "ok": true,
        "price": 136.5,
        "typedGone": true,
        "keepsOnce": {
          "labourCost": 20,
          "packagingCost": 5
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "why": "LABOUR, one part agreed (50): the labour and packaging are priced on the costed share (80 of 100): (80 + 25 × 0.8) × 1.3 + 50 = 180",
      "cart": {
        "labourCost": 20,
        "packagingCost": 5,
        "parts": [
          {
            "id": "P1",
            "name": "body",
            "qty": 2,
            "printWeight": 100,
            "printTime": 2,
            "baseCost": 80
          },
          {
            "id": "P2",
            "name": "stand",
            "qty": 1,
            "printWeight": 20,
            "printTime": 1,
            "baseCost": 20,
            "agreedPrice": 50
          }
        ]
      },
      "asQuote": true,
      "typed": 999,
      "req": {},
      "want": {
        "ok": true,
        "price": 180,
        "keepsOnce": {
          "labourCost": 20,
          "packagingCost": 5
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
